WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.350
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.490
Check it!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.480
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.910
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.790
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.220
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.530
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.570
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.380
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.410
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.490
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.990
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.500
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.270
Fly up, angel

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:33.870
One, two, three!

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:42.650
Yeah! I was gonna write a report
on Osaka's famous foods...

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.060
Huh? Hello?

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:50.160
Your girl in Tokyo?

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.900
No! My teacher at school...!

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:56.700
You're goin' out with yer teacher?!

00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:02.770
Great! Get her to come too!
We can all have some fun!

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:08.910
No, I've had enough...!

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:13.610
Say, you ever sent a frog flying?

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:19.350
Put fireworks up their butt
and they go really far!

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:27.530
Whenever someone refuses
my invitations...

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:30.520
...I send them flying like frogs!

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:35.260
--Here goes! One, two, three!
--No, stop!

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.780
Ow...

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:46.580
Do all Tokyo kids sit
on top of the water?

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:52.280
I like you! Watch! I'll do it too!

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:59.230
Why? Why can't I sit on it?!

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:04.670
What's your name?

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:08.470
I asked you a question!

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.240
Alright, Tokyo!

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:16.540
You go deaf on your bullet
train here or something?!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.710
Jo.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:24.580
'Jo.' Jo what?

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:29.650
--Curry-ri Sue.
--Jo... Curry-ri Sue...

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.720
Are you mocking me?!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.760
--Your pencil broke.
--And whose fault is that?!

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:45.270
You were at last night's D.D.D.

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:48.640
Masa-<i>yan</i> cried when he saw
this morning's sports page!

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.270
"Mega Rider is Mega Embarrassment"

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:56.550
--What were you doing there, anyway?
--Part-time work.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:04:00.220
What kind of part-timer
carries big guns like these

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:03.190
and gets in the way of police investigations?!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.350
Cut the crap...!

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:13.100
Can't you be a little more lady-like?

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:17.640
This is Hanshin Police, Inc.
A top corporation.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:21.710
--I-I'm...
--A former big-shot biker.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:26.240
Maybe so, but you can't
wave toys around forever.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.680
I'm sorry...

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.420
--Ever heard of Kanbaku?
--Hell, no...!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.190
What's your prob--

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.990
But...!

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.420
It's a Kansai motorcycle group.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:46.290
Takane used to be its leader.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.700
You don't wanna get her too angry.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.610
<i>That should teach her!</i>

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:59.200
--So you're not a circus bike rider?
--Why, you little...!

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.620
The Hanshin Police was originally
founded as a private organization

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.890
by the old <i>bakuto</i> gamblers.

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.860
The citizens really depend on us too!

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:13.630
In other words...

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.190
...we're the ones holding
this city together!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.460
Takane...!

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:23.600
Being our enemy here...

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:28.100
...means you're the
enemy of all of Osaka!

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.780
--You get it?
--No.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.610
You want a thrashing?!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.210
Bad news!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:44.320
First a train goes flying,
then curry rice...

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:49.200
Masa-<i>yan</i>! I'm sorry! Are you okay?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.300
So what's the big problem?

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.900
A huge monster corpse
was found in Dotonbori!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:55.300
"Monster Found at Pick-Up Bridge!!"

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:59.170
Some moron jumped onto
it and got a nosebleed.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.400
--Let's go!
--Right!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.950
Oh, and you have a visitor, Tokyo.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:12.180
--Masa-<i>yan</i>! Hurry!
--Let me wash my face at least!

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:20.860
--You've really caused a scene here...
--It caused itself.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:24.860
Not only was I severely scolded,
we also had our budget cut.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.230
--I'll at least treat you to some udon.
--Really?

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:31.140
In that case, I'd prefer okonomiyaki!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:37.180
So this monster of yours is--

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:40.410
Yeah, the same as all the others.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:44.180
Its brain was probably glowing, too.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:49.550
A runaway train accident
and then a monster...

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.380
Doesn't it seem a
little too convenient?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:57.700
If these two incidents
<i>are</i> connected...

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.700
...there might still be
something in store.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:05.330
Now that there's no work for us,
there's no reason to stay here.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.280
That's one huge beetle!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:12.780
You idiot! No beetles get that big!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:17.620
That's the foreign
'Great Heracles Stag Beetle'.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:21.050
I'm pretty sure it
was in your bug book!

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:26.210
I hear they're going to
protect this town...

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:30.060
Goodbye before I can pay back my debt?

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:37.570
Professional killers
<i>will</i> aim for the head!

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:41.530
You can't rely on bulletproof
vests! Remember that!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:47.370
--Good work today!
--Thanks...

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:57.460
I've loved this ever
since I was little...!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:59.150
Oh, that's right...

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:04.590
We have to protect it.

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:08.600
We have to protect this
town with our own hands.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.470
--No matter what happens.
--Yes.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.480
"Assault Section -
Tiger, Hawk, Shark Units"

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:22.270
We appreciate your hard work!

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:25.140
Likewise.

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.790
--Good work, Chief!
--Excellent work today!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:32.160
Dad...!

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:35.060
--That's 'Chief'!
--Yes, sir!

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:38.000
I'm about to cross the Hakone Wall.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.400
You're going to Tokyo?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.940
The National Public Safety
Council wants to preach to me

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.770
about these incidents.

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:50.300
--Hold down the fort while I'm gone.
--Yes, sir!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.240
The festival's coming up soon...

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:59.690
It must not be cancelled. Rout
them out before then. Got that?

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:00.890
We'll do our utmost!

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.690
--Oh, and Masa-<i>yan</i>...
--Yes, sir?!

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.360
Today's Miri-<i>chan</i>'s birthday, right?

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:09.600
Yes! She's now three, thanks to you!

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:13.870
It must be tough to neglect your
adorable daughter. Forgive me.

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:17.170
It's no problem at all, sir...!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.040
--Takane...!
--Yes?!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:26.250
Don't forget about
visiting your mom's grave.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.870
I won't!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.820
Salute!

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:35.320
Come back safely!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.810
Dad...

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.240
What the hell's your problem?!

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.070
Moron!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.740
Are you all right?!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:57.980
Yes...

00:09:57.980 --> 00:09:59.910
I'm really sorry!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:04.040
Just another unlicensed driver
who doesn't know about us.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:09.250
They've really gone up in number
since that train accident...!

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:15.700
Someday I'll teach 'em all a lesson.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:20.100
I have friends driving all
over Osaka - there's no escape!

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:24.660
Driver! Can you follow
that truck just now?!

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:27.870
Come again?

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.210
Oh, Django...

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:34.710
You're my greatest
masterpiece, Django...

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.480
You're so adorable--

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.820
Right. Bye.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.620
Amy!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.650
Are you up?

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:50.630
Good morning, Meg!

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.300
What are you doing...?

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:58.130
Nothing, just a little
communication...!

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:04.240
What're you gonna be like
when you grow up...?

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:08.550
Anyway, Sei wants us all in Osaka!

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:11.150
Osaka?! Let's go, let's go!

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:11.350
"No Trespassing"

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:15.390
--But who's gonna drive?
--Leo-<i>chin</i>!

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:15.850
"No Trespassing"

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:22.330
The truck has turned
west on Ninjo Avenue.

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.930
Request someone to follow.

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:29.060
Roger that. It's currently stopped
at a light 150 meters from there!

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:32.940
Thanks, fellas!
We just caught up to it!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.770
Yeah. They're the ones from Tokyo...

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:42.580
One of 'em has some big guns.
Best be careful.

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:51.620
I'm in front of the Diet Building,

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.860
where the National Public
Safety Council has convened

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:58.160
to discuss the series of
terrorist incidents in Osaka.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.330
Chief Katsu of the Hanshin
Police visited this morning

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.240
to explain the situation.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:07.110
This is an anonymous recording
that was addressed to the council

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.400
after the train incident.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:14.580
Bet you were shocked, huh?

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.780
Now, now. Don't mock the
discount supermarket.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:21.480
You're gravely mistaken if
you think this is over!

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:26.490
Listen, I <i>will</i> crush the police.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:32.830
That's not all; I'll crush Osaka
itself. Look forward to it!

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.630
Unbelievable...!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:39.640
--What on earth is this, Chief Katsu?!
--Tell us the truth!

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.230
Everyone, please calm down!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:45.680
Chief Katsu plans to head to
RAPT HQ afterward to discuss

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:49.450
further countermeasures with
anti-terrorism specialists.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.490
This can't be real!
Right, Assistant Inspector?!

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:56.050
I'm gonna check the guard deployment!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.000
Playing detective in Osaka?

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.300
Do you recognize that mark?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.300
It was also on that train
we chased a while back.

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:11.240
So?

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.740
It means there may be a
connection between it

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:15.980
and the monster you fought at the D.D.D.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:20.080
But why is the truck stopped
in a place like this?

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.340
That's what we're about to find out.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.320
--What is it?!
--The driver's dead!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.690
--What does this mean?
--It's probably... a trap!

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:38.290
--Hey! Not so rough!
--Sorry, didn't mean to!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.470
--More importantly, crawl under the truck!
--Right!

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:53.430
There!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.520
Okay, Sei! You can come out now...

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:21.500
Sei!

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:34.150
Hey! I'm picking up a <i>huge</i> EM signal!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.590
And it's flying, despite
being super gigantic!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:38.690
Where's it headed?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:42.790
Let's see... Something that
looks like Tokyo Tower!

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:02.920
What's that cretin doing?!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.180
What is that huge
Buddha-looking thing?!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:08.710
Maybe it's on a trip
from Nara or Kyoto?!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:13.450
What on earth is going on?!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:19.190
The ultra-powerful Giant-Bot, Gigantes!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.330
What are you planning to do?!

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:26.910
You're a top detective, ain't ya?
Why not use some logic?!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:30.200
Don't tell me you're going to
demolish Tsutenkaku Tower?!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:34.480
Sounds interesting.
Maybe I'll do just that...

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:37.680
Don't screw with me! I'll kill you!

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.120
Ooh, scary!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.250
The detective who's too
busy to tend to his family

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.220
has a short temper!

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.260
What was that...?!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.600
Emergency situation!

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:55.800
Attention all mobile units and
armored cars within Osaka city limits!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.970
All units are to rush
immediately to Shinsekai!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.060
Roger!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:05.580
What the hell?! Don't make
me turn ya into sashimi!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:08.310
Yeah! Stop hurtin' our business!

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:12.780
--It's huge...!
--What're you so scared for?!

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:21.260
Historical structures attract
people and become town symbols.

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.760
Tsutenkaku Tower is marvelous...

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:27.600
Why are you holding me here?!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:32.090
No reason. I just want you to watch.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.710
Watch Osaka's public
safety collapse, that is.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:40.610
And then our time will
naturally come...

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:44.520
What? You're going
to take over Osaka?!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:49.280
To be frank, I've always
been jealous of you.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:50.820
Jealous of what?!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:57.430
The liveliness that
Osaka is filled with.

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.930
How does Tokyo compare to that?

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:03.840
<i>This</i> is the result of accepting
people without restriction!

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:07.270
That's the reason why
I established RAPT...

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:11.280
To dispose of those who
hinder the city's development.

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:14.310
You guys are insane...!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:19.220
If you'll work for us, you can
avoid the worst possible situation.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:22.350
It's the sort of 'bargain'
you're so fond of.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:26.980
We've put our heart and soul
into protecting Osaka...!

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.390
We don't need your help!

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:33.330
Think clearly...

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:37.830
Who do you think you are?! <i>You</i>
turned Tokyo into a rotting dump!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:43.240
Commoners' blood still flows on
the other side of the Hakone Wall!

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.070
Which means Naniwa's tenacity does too!

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:55.350
In that case, show me
this tenacity of yours...

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:59.950
This is Masa of Tiger 1!
All units, begin assault!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:08.190
--Yeah! Take that!
--Howdya like that, scum?!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.830
Yes!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.920
<i>Takane...</i>

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:47.010
Assistant Inspector!
Where are you?! Assist--

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.270
Masa-<i>yan</i>...

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:54.270
Have you seen the assistant
inspector? Wasn't he with you?!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.920
Masa-<i>yan</i>...

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:00.210
Takane... I have a request...

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:07.690
When my daughter...
when Miri grows up...

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:12.330
...could you give her your
special Kanbaku outfit...?

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.970
I beg you...!

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:18.300
And... don't hold back
against any traitors...

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:22.470
Naniwa's justice will never die...!

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:24.010
Masa-<i>yan</i>!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:30.110
Miri...! Your dad was
a great detective!

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:33.910
He was happy to protect
this town with his life...!

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:39.450
He was a very handsome detective...!

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:48.230
How do ya like that?!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:51.170
I got another where that came from!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.660
What the...?!

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:27.500
--Hurry!
--I know, I know!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:29.670
Who are you...?

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:34.080
--Takane-<i>san</i> of the Hanshin Police?
--Yeah...

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.340
That's Jo in there.

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:49.120
Not good!

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:05.810
Let Jo go! Let go, let go!

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:12.280
Gigantes! Crush that
thing like a tin can!

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:19.320
We're in danger!
Hurry into the trailer!

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:36.930
Why...?

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:05.060
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:05.060 --> 00:22:12.700
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:20.410
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:29.780
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:36.320
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:45.400
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:52.310
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:18.170
<i>Spoiled justice. Betrayed
trust. Lingering sadness...</i>

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:21.640
<i>And inept heroes who rise
from the brink of despair!</i>

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:26.700
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Bloody Battle! Naniwa Hoodlums"
